<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/linkaccount.css">

<div class="link-account-content">
    <div id="linkCodeSection">
        <h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                stroke="#007E6E" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="lucide lucide-link-icon lucide-link">
                <path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71" />
                <path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71" />
            </svg>
            <span>Your link code</span>
        </h4>
        <p>Share this code with your friend or family members</p>

        <div id="linkCodeDisplay">
            <p>Link Code</p>
            <h1 id="linkCode">USER-1</h1>

            <div id="copyCode">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                    class="lucide lucide-user-plus-icon lucide-user-plus">
                    <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                    <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                    <line x1="19" x2="19" y1="8" y2="14" />
                    <line x1="22" x2="16" y1="11" y2="11" />
                </svg>
                Copy Code
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>When your partner or family member creates an account, they can enter this code to link to your pregnancy
            journey. They'll be able to view your progress and receive tips on how to support you.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="linkAccountSection">
        <h4>Linked Accounts</h4>
        <p>People connected to this pregnancy journey</p>

        <div class="linkedAccount">
            <div class="userInfo">
                <div class="userIcon">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                        stroke="#007E6E" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                        class="lucide lucide-user-icon lucide-user">
                        <path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                        <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4" />
                    </svg>
                </div>

                <div class="userDetails">
                    <div class="username">John Johnson</div>
                    <div class="email">john@gmail.com</div>
                    <div class="dateLinked">Linked since 01/11/2025</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="actions">
                <button class="removeButton">Remove</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="permissionSection">
        <h3>Privacy & Permissions</h3>
        <p>When you link accounts, the following information is shared:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Pregnancy week and due date</li>
            <li>Health logs and symptom tracking</li>
            <li>Progress reports and charts</li>
            <li>Appointment information (if added)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You can remove linked accounts at any time. Linked users will not have access to edit your information - they
            can only view what you've logged.</p>
    </div>
</div>